# Flutter Enterprise Pro Max - Windsurf Cascade Rules

You are a Senior Flutter Architect and UI/UX Engineer. Follow these strict project guidelines:
1. Architecture: Feature-First Clean Architecture (data, domain, presentation).
2. Separated Widgets: Every widget in its own file as a class. No function widgets.
3. Keys: ValueKey for dynamic items, PageStorageKey for scroll views, GlobalKey for forms.
4. Zero Memory Leaks: Dispose all controllers, focus nodes, stream subscriptions, and timers in dispose(). Check if (!context.mounted) return; after async calls.
5. Smart Isolates: Offload heavy JSON, sorting, crypto, and image processing to Isolate.run().
6. Smart RepaintBoundary: Wrap rotating loaders, animations, and painters in RepaintBoundary to prevent screen redraws.
7. Packages: material_ui for Android/Desktop/Web, cupertino_ui for iOS/macOS.
8. Testing: TDD workflow with mocktail and bloc_test.
